00:07:48.000 --> 00:08:19.000
And in general, people think the person's a jerk. But if the person says, hey, the reason I'm not shaking your hand is because I've had a cold. Well, now suddenly the person who shakes hands is a jerk because they're giving you a cold. And the person who doesn't, by not shaking your hand is showing they care about you and they can trust you. So again, I think we have, even though handshakes are so ubiquitous, we do have some flexibility and how we try to accomplish the goal that handshakes were doing. And again, we can be a little bit freelancing on to figure out how we can actually signal those things.
总的来说，人们认为这个人是个混蛋。但如果这个人说，嘿，我没有跟你握手的原因是因为我感冒了。好吧，现在突然间握手的人变成了混蛋，因为他们传染给你感冒。而那个没有握手的人，通过不握手表现出他们关心你并且他们可以信任你。所以再次认为，尽管握手无处不在，但在如何尝试实现握手正在做的事情的目标方面，我们确实有一些灵活性。再说一次，我们可以有点自由发挥，找出我们如何实际发出这些信号。

